      "section": "Barcode rank",
      "order": 3,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "Rank barcodes by UMI count and the curve drops in two regimes: a gently declining plateau over the called cells, then a steep power-law fall into the empty-droplet background. The dotted cutoff line marks where sample_A and sample_B's `is_cell` flag switches off; sample_B calls fewer, noisier cells than sample_A. Log axes and the cutoff line toggle live in the Settings \u2699 popover.\n",
      "wf_tag": "python/advanced_viz_demo"
